   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ukerewe Rural Electrifica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Landsbygdselektrifiering: Utbyggnad av eln&#xe4;tet (33 kV) fr&#xe5;n Nansio till 32 byar p&#xe5; &#xf6;n Ukerewe i Viktoriasj&#xf6;n i norra Tanzania f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad tillg&#xe5;ng till h&#xe5;llbar, tillf&#xf6;rlitlig elektricitet till &#xf6;verkomligt pris f&#xf6;r socio-ekonomisk utveckling och fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Electrification: Grid extension of electricity (33 kV) from Nansio to 32 villages on Ukerewe Island in Lake Victoria, northern Tanzania for increased access to reliable, sustainable and affordable electricity for socio-economic development and poverty alleviation.</narrative>
  </description>
